Insertion Sort

Algorithm: 

InsertionSort(arr, n)
Step 1: Start
Step 2: Repeat for i = 1 to n - 1:
2.1: Set key = arr[i]
2.2: Set j = i - 1
2.3: Repeat while j >= 0 and arr[j] > key:
2.3.1: arr[j + 1] = arr[j]
2.3.2: j--
2.4: arr[j + 1] = key
Step 3: Exit / Stop


Time Complexities:

Best Case: O(n)
Average Case: O(n^2)
Worst Case: O(n^2)
